# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository.
# Added 2026-08-11: the working tree had flipped to CRLF, turning a 418-line
# feature diff into a 5,243-line whitespace churn that destroyed reviewability
# and `git blame`. Pinning eol=lf keeps diffs honest across Windows/macOS/Linux
# and matches what Cloudflare Workers and Node consume. No tooling depends on CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch, never diff as text.
*.png  binary
*.webp binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
